[00:07.55]You used to run with paint-stained jeans
[00:10.25]Now you dress clean for your angry scenes
[00:13.09]Same old mouth, brand new line
[00:15.86]Rebellion — sponsored, limited-time
[00:18.96]♫
[00:23.37]You hated flags, you hated chants
[00:24.81]Funny how you learned the dance
[00:26.35]Raise your fist — then fall in line
[00:27.62]Say it’s truth — collect the dime
[00:30.95]SAME SHIT —
[00:31.74]NEW CHOIR
