[00:46.18]REBEL — REBEL
[00:50.59]You said history’s a rotten lie
[00:53.54]Now you rhyme like it never died
[00:56.53]Same fear, different disguise
[00:59.12]Same shit dressed in “open eyes”
[01:01.81]You said you’d never wear their skin
[01:03.59]Guess it fits when you crawl right in
[01:06.17]You don’t shout, you don’t fight
[01:07.95]You just echo what feels right
[01:10.63]SAME SHIT —
[01:11.22]NEW CHOIR
